k></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA RIKIYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUDA KAZUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUJI TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA, KEIICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA, KOTARO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, RIKIYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUDA, KAZUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJI, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An exhaust gas treating device comprising a first cooler that is installed in the rear stage of a decomposing section for decomposing exhaust gas at high temperature and that has a liquid spray section for spraying liquid on the treated gas from the decomposing section, a second cooler for cooling the treated gas sprayed with liquid in the first cooler to reduce the volume of the treated gas, and a powder arresting section for arresting the powder contained in the treated gas, which has been cooled in the second cooler, by spraying the treated gas with liquid.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de traitement des gaz d'échappement, ce dispositif comprenant un premier refroidisseur installé dans la partie arrière d'une section de décomposition, destinée à décomposer les gaz d'échappement à température élevée. Ce premier refroidisseur est pourvu d'une section de pulvérisation de liquide conçue pour pulvériser un liquide sur les gaz traités, depuis ladite section de décomposition. Ce dispositif comporte également un second refroidisseur, permettant de refroidir les gaz traités sur lesquels a été pulvérisé le liquide du premier refroidisseur, afin de réduire le volume des gaz traités. Ce dispositif comprend enfin une section de rétention de poudre, destinée à retenir la poudre contenue dans les gaz traités refroidis dans le second refroidisseur, un liquide étant pulvérisé sur ces gaz traités.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>